The '''2026–27 season''' is the 57th season in the history of [[Paris Saint-Germain FC|Paris Saint-Germain]], and the club's 53rd consecutive season in the [[Ligue 1|French top flight]]. The club is participating in [[2026–27 Ligue 1|Ligue 1]], the [[2026–27 Coupe de France|Coupe de France]], the [[2026 Trophée des Champions|Trophée des Champions]], the [[2026–27 UEFA Champions League|UEFA Champions League]], the [[2026 UEFA Super Cup|UEFA Super Cup]] and the [[2026 FIFA Intercontinental Cup|FIFA Intercontinental Cup]].

